    {
      "id": "nikko-world-heritage-loop",
      "placeId": "nikko-in-the-cedars",
      "title": "Nikko: a World Heritage shrine-and-temple walk",
      "introduction": "Start at Tobu-Nikko Station, take the World Heritage bus to Shinkyo, then follow the historic precinct through Rinnoji, Toshogu, Futarasan Shrine and Taiyuin. Return to the station by bus from the Taiyuin/Futarasan stop. The mapped connectors show visit order only, not roads or walking paths.",
