          "name": "Shinkyo Bridge",
          "area": "Kamihatsuishi, Nikko",
          "address": "Shinkyo Bridge, Nikko, Tochigi, Japan",
          "story": "Begin at the vermilion bridge over the Daiya River, the sacred threshold to Nikko's shrine-and-temple landscape. The bridge belongs to Futarasan-jinja and is part of the World Heritage site.",
          "coordinates": {
            "latitude": 36.7533178,
