          "area": "Sannai, Nikko",
          "address": "Nikkosan Rinnoji Temple Sanbutsudo, Sannai, Nikko, Tochigi, Japan",
          "story": "At Sanbutsudo, Rinnoji's main hall, three large Buddha figures represent Nikko's sacred mountains. The temple precinct was founded by the monk Shodo.",
          "coordinates": {
            "latitude": 36.7551406,
