          "name": "Nikko Futarasan-jinja Shrine",
          "area": "Sannai, Nikko",
          "address": "Nikko Futarasan-jinja Shrine, Sannai, Nikko, Tochigi, Japan",
          "story": "Founded in 782, the shrine is dedicated to the deities of Nikko's three sacred mountains. Its main shrine grounds sit beside Toshogu and the forested temple precinct.",
