          "address": "Taiyuin Mausoleum, Sannai, Nikko, Tochigi, Japan",
          "story": "Taiyuin is the mausoleum of Tokugawa Iemitsu. Its richly decorated gates and prayer hall honor his grandfather Ieyasu with a deliberately more restrained scale than Toshogu.",
